   3.2 Check Cargo.toml for workspace members or feature flags that affect testing.
{% elif lang == "java" %}
   3.1 Check for pom.xml (Maven), build.gradle (Gradle), or build.xml (Ant).
   3.2 Run the relevant tests with `mvn test`, `gradle test`, or `ant test` as appropriate.
{% elif lang == "c" or lang == "cpp" or lang == "c++" %}
   3.1 Check for CMakeLists.txt, Makefile, configure.ac, or meson.build.
   3.2 Build the project and run the relevant tests to observe the current state.
{% elif lang == "javascript" or lang == "typescript" or lang == "node" %}
